    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hailborn: UFO Stole My Egg!&quot; is a funny souls-like action game. Play as Chico, a chicken head, floating arms, and human legs, on a mission to reclaim her stolen egg from an alien UFO.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous dungeons called '<strong>Hail'\u00a0</strong>to collect '<strong>wooden planks'</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>axe</strong> to attack, and your <strong>gunblade</strong> to parry enemies or shoot them from a distance</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>wooden planks</strong> to build bridges connect islands, bringing you closer to the UFO crash site\u00a0and your stolen egg</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Hailborn: UFO Stole My Egg!&quot; is a funny souls-like action game. Play as Chico, a chicken head, floating arms, and human legs, on a mission to reclaim her stolen egg from an alien UFO.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore dangerous dungeons called '<strong>Hail'\u00a0</strong>to collect '<strong>wooden planks'</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your <strong>axe</strong> to attack, and your <strong>gunblade</strong> to parry enemies or shoot them from a distance</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Goal</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>wooden planks</strong> to build bridges connect islands, bringing you closer to the UFO crash site\u00a0and your stolen egg</p>",
